  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 4.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.86,
      "end_seconds": 10.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "not at all, please sit what seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.91,
      "end_seconds": 24.92,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "um, so the thing is, I've got a tight band around my head. I've never really been one for hospitals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.98,
      "end_seconds": 32.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "did it come on recently? I ask because it helps me narrow things down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.55,
      "end_seconds": 36.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "It's been two weeks now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.72,
      "end_seconds": 41.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Understood. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.59,
      "end_seconds": 49.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Um, yes, long screen days. That makes it worse. I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.8,
      "end_seconds": 53.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "So, have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.05,
      "end_seconds": 60.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Just my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.32,
      "end_seconds": 69.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.84,
      "end_seconds": 74.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.51,
      "end_seconds": 82.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.27,
      "end_seconds": 86.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.04,
      "end_seconds": 92.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.95,
      "end_seconds": 97.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.37,
      "end_seconds": 99.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.41,
      "end_seconds": 103.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.82,
      "end_seconds": 123.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.83,
      "end_seconds": 128.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.88,
      "end_seconds": 148.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.26,
      "end_seconds": 153.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "yes, tramadol, it gives me vomiting"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.12,
      "end_seconds": 157.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.3,
      "end_seconds": 160.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.66,
      "end_seconds": 166.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.42,
      "end_seconds": 170.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.4,
      "end_seconds": 176.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "So, have you noticed blurred vision, sensitivity to light or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.32,
      "end_seconds": 181.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.34,
      "end_seconds": 185.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "And And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.58,
      "end_seconds": 187.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 190.66,
      "end_seconds": 200.28,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Saturation 98 percent, BP is 121 over 82, pulse is 81 beats a minute. Temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.36,
      "end_seconds": 202.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.47,
      "end_seconds": 208.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.47,
      "end_seconds": 213.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Alright, I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.34,
      "end_seconds": 235.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.3,
      "end_seconds": 241.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "you can sit up now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.73,
      "end_seconds": 263.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, this is probably tension-type headache"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.11,
      "end_seconds": 267.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.71,
      "end_seconds": 306.2,
      "duration_seconds": 37.49,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's tension-type headache, and we'll know more once the an eye test is back. Let's get an eye test, for eye strain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches. Keep an eye out, and if the headache becomes sudden and severe, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.5,
      "end_seconds": 310.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.02,
      "end_seconds": 316.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}